                <pb facs="pm_d5-1" n="1" xml:id="pm_d5-1"/>

                <head>PM–5. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>In an exchange of notes between Ambassador Julian F.
                        Harrington and Foreign Minister Moreno on August 5 and 16, 1958, respectively, the United States
                    Government and the Republic of Panama concluded an agreement that entered into
                    force on August 16, 1958, to extend the agreement of August 5, 1957, authorizing
                    the inspection by Panamanian nautical inspectors of vessels of Panamanian
                    registry in the Canal Zone (8 UST 1413). For
                    the texts of the notes exchanged, see 9 UST
                    1146. Documentation concerning the negotiation of this agreement is in
                    Department of State file 611.19.</p>
            </div>
